        {
          "id": 809810645,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I have just discovered (I think) the cause of the problem. The project was in a group that was set as private. I have changed the group to Public, and then it allowed be to set the project as Public. \"Allow commits from members who can merge to the target branch\" is now enabled. The pipeline (whatever that means) has now been successful.\n\nDario, many thanks for your help.",
